<title>USA: HealthSouth acquires ReadiCare.</title>
<headline>HealthSouth acquires ReadiCare.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>HealthSouth Corp said Tuesday it had completed the acquisition of ReadiCare Inc and would proceed to combine ReadiCare's 37 occupational health centers with its existing network.</p>
<p>HealthSouth is the largest U.S. provider of outpatient surgery and rehabilitative healthcare services.</p>
<p>Company officials were not available to comment on the acquisition or give further details.</p>
<p>Previously, HealthSouth said the merger was worth about $70 million.</p>
